<div class="page-head" style="justify-content:center;">
  <h1>Ask Mizan</h1>
</div>

<div style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;">

  <div class="composer">
    <textarea id="ask-input" placeholder="What are my biggest spending categories?"></textarea>
    <div class="composer-bar">
      <span style="font-size:0.75rem; color:var(--fg-faint);">Educational guidance only — not financial advice</span>
      <button class="send-btn" id="ask-send" title="Send">↑</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="ask-thread" style="display:none; flex-direction:column; gap:0.6rem; margin-top:1rem;"></div>

  <p style="text-align:center; font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--fg-muted); margin:1.4rem 0 0.7rem;">Ask Mizan questions like…</p>
  <div class="suggest-grid">
    <button class="suggest" data-ask-suggest>Am I taking on too much risk in my portfolio?</button>
    <button class="suggest" data-ask-suggest>How did my net worth change this month?</button>
    <button class="suggest" data-ask-suggest>What were my top 3 biggest expenses this month?</button>
    <button class="suggest" data-ask-suggest>Is my super fund's growth option right for my age?</button>
    <button class="suggest" data-ask-suggest>Should I pay extra off my HECS before indexation?</button>
    <button class="suggest" data-ask-suggest>How is the market affecting my portfolio?</button>
  </div>

  <div class="banner banner-danger">
    <div class="banner-head">
      <span>⚠ Low data warning</span>
      <a href="/dashboard/assets" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Add Asset or Liability</a>
    </div>
    <strong style="font-size:0.85rem;">Not enough assets &amp; liabilities.</strong>
    <p>Without a good understanding of your finances, Mizan can only speak in generalities. Add more assets, liabilities or connect a bank to get sharper, personalised education.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="assistant-card" style="margin-top:1rem;">
    <div class="avatar">M</div>
    <div>
      <div style="font-weight:600; font-size:0.95rem;">I'm Mizan — your personal CFO-level advisor.</div>
      <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--fg-muted); margin:0.4rem 0 0; line-height:1.6;">
        I read your financial statements, bank accounts and transactions so you can understand your financial
        situation — portfolio analysis, spending patterns, super health and more. I explain; the decisions stay yours.
        What would you like to explore today?
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
